    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7290" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπό-στᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unable to escape from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					526
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Beroe</span>): abs., <i>without means of
				escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1469.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπότης ἀ.</span>”
				<i>from whom there is no escape,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.166e
				</span></i>
			 (codd.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>inseparable,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				40
			</span></i>.</div>
